DESCRIPTION >
    Integrations: day-over-day conversion comparison (Promise.all batch).
    Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/integrations.js:93-100 (queryName 'integ_conversions').
    Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id, event ->
    event_type. No JSON-bag fields. IDENTICAL query text to
    alert_conversions.pipe (api/routes/alerts.js:54) — duplicate logic,
    Phase-6 consolidation candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE integ_conversions_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 1 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS today,
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 2 DAY AND timestamp < now() - INTERVAL 1 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS yesterday
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 2 DAY

TYPE endpoint
